# "Ninja" and "Rogue" are creature type words of Silver-Fur Master's third ability (CR 612.2), so Artificial Evolution changes which
# creatures it pumps. Fang of Shigeki is a Snake Ninja, Robber of the Rich a Human Archer Rogue. Ninja to Goblin: Fang is 1/1 again,
# Robber still 3/3. Then Rogue to Snake: the text says "Other Goblin and Snake creatures", so Fang is 2/2 again and Robber 2/2.

